      "title": "Announcement SEL-2026-10: Selling Guide Updates",
      "summary": "Fannie Mae\u2019s November Selling Guide update addresses accessory dwelling units in condominium projects, owner-occupancy policy, Community Seconds and grants, expanded use of VantageScore 4.0, and premium recapture for whole loans. Review the announcement for the effective date of each policy change.",
